(5668731, 824967, 31917, '<td valign="top">what a great supject, unfortunetly the lighting wasn''t there but mostly its the composition that keeps this great subject from being a great photo.  you may not have had many options if there was limited options on where to stand.. but cutting off the top of the tree and having no negative space hurts it alot.  still... very cool tree and rock.</td>', 'what a great supject, unfortunetly the lighting wasn''t there but mostly its the composition that keeps this great subject from being a great photo.  you may not have had many options if there was limited options on where to stand.. but cutting off the top of the tree and having no negative space hurts it alot.  still... very cool tree and rock.', '2009-10-01 02:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668733, 824972, 31917, '<td valign="top">so simple..nothing that is really powerful or of great interest yet the warmth color and simplicity of this carries it through and keeps me wanting to stare at it.</td>', 'so simple..nothing that is really powerful or of great interest yet the warmth color and simplicity of this carries it through and keeps me wanting to stare at it.', '2009-10-01 02:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668734, 824508, 31917, '<td valign="top">sorry, but my first reaction to this was anger... i was very upset that i hadn''t taken this!  love it..perfect... if i had to find something to say it would just be to go a little less dark at the top so the top of the last ballon keeps it''s outline a little better.  LOVE THIS</td>', 'sorry, but my first reaction to this was anger... i was very upset that i hadn''t taken this!  love it..perfect... if i had to find something to say it would just be to go a little less dark at the top so the top of the last ballon keeps it''s outline a little better.  LOVE THIS', '2009-10-01 02:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
