(5668918, 824896, 103032, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  Looks like pretty good DOF. Nice reflection of the slopes and the northern lights.  Nice capture of the northern lights and the specks of stars.  This image really stands out.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  Looks like pretty good DOF. Nice reflection of the slopes and the northern lights.  Nice capture of the northern lights and the specks of stars.  This image really stands out.', '2009-10-01 07:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668920, 822987, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the tones of the B&amp;W.  The rocks give the foreground some interest, the sky is dramatic, very nice details in the trees next to the castle.  Looks like a well done image.</td>', 'Like the tones of the B&W.  The rocks give the foreground some interest, the sky is dramatic, very nice details in the trees next to the castle.  Looks like a well done image.', '2009-10-01 07:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668923, 824516, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque.  Nice DOF, very crisp and clean image.  The colors of the sunset and the sky look very natural.  Nice silkiness of the water.  Like how the outcropping of the rocks walk the viewer out to the sunset.  A breath taking image.</td>', 'Very picturesque.  Nice DOF, very crisp and clean image.  The colors of the sunset and the sky look very natural.  Nice silkiness of the water.  Like how the outcropping of the rocks walk the viewer out to the sunset.  A breath taking image.', '2009-10-01 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668927, 825059, 7010, '<td valign="top">Well executed. Lighting is perfect, lots of detail. Maybe it would have been even better with a more natural background. 7</td>', 'Well executed. Lighting is perfect, lots of detail. Maybe it would have been even better with a more natural background. 7', '2009-10-01 08:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668928, 824548, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice! I love the composition on this one. Welldone 7</td>', 'Nice! I love the composition on this one. Welldone 7', '2009-10-01 08:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668930, 819705, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice! Very well executed. I specially like the combination between the natural elements and the steel cable. Overall, the pic has a very natural feel. 8</td>', 'Nice! Very well executed. I specially like the combination between the natural elements and the steel cable. Overall, the pic has a very natural feel. 8', '2009-10-01 08:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668933, 824616, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great image in silhouette; the sun is in the perfect spot.  Like how the viewer can see the outline of her face and most of the outline of his face.  I''m just waiting for him to kiss her and then they can ride off into the sunset.  Very romantic image.  Well done.</td>', 'Great image in silhouette; the sun is in the perfect spot.  Like how the viewer can see the outline of her face and most of the outline of his face.  I''m just waiting for him to kiss her and then they can ride off into the sunset.  Very romantic image.  Well done.', '2009-10-01 08:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668941, 824914, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hihi, what a cute little pumpkin... The lighting is Ok. B&amp;W was a good choice for this image. It maybe needs a tad more contrast. Composition: the chosen angle and the little bit messy hair and dress gives it a kind of a candid-shot feel. 6</td>', 'Hihi, what a cute little pumpkin... The lighting is Ok. B&W was a good choice for this image. It maybe needs a tad more contrast. Composition: the chosen angle and the little bit messy hair and dress gives it a kind of a candid-shot feel. 6', '2009-10-01 08:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668948, 824979, 27133, '<td valign="top">Nice work....but watch she doesn''t drop the ash on her skin....trust me...that hurts!  LOL!</td>', 'Nice work....but watch she doesn''t drop the ash on her skin....trust me...that hurts!  LOL!', '2009-10-01 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668958, 824273, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the moment, their clothes and the post processing.  Maybe a bit too much noise on the horse but that''s just nitpicking.  I dunno, I like this shot, the only real thing that I could think of to make it better was another backround than white, like a sunset or something like that?</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the moment, their clothes and the post processing.  Maybe a bit too much noise on the horse but that''s just nitpicking.  I dunno, I like this shot, the only real thing that I could think of to make it better was another backround than white, like a sunset or something like that?', '2009-10-01 08:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668961, 824782, 7010, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, i don''t know what to think of this image. It looks a bit flat and uninteresting to me. You could ad more depth by including elements in the foreground. The cabin alone as point of interest is not appealing enough to me. Also I think that the portrait format is not the most ideal for shooting a scene like this. It could be a good choice with e.g. dramatic skies, lots of vertical elements or patterns a.s.o. Otherwise a landscape format usually works better for subjects like this. 5</td>', 'Mmmm, i don''t know what to think of this image. It looks a bit flat and uninteresting to me. You could ad more depth by including elements in the foreground. The cabin alone as point of interest is not appealing enough to me. Also I think that the portrait format is not the most ideal for shooting a scene like this. It could be a good choice with e.g. dramatic skies, lots of vertical elements or patterns a.s.o. Otherwise a landscape format usually works better for subjects like this. 5', '2009-10-01 08:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668964, 824906, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. A little nitpick: the slightly darker areas at the top of the frame and the out of focus blue leafs at the top left make the shot a bit messy i.m.o. 6</td>', 'Nice capture. A little nitpick: the slightly darker areas at the top of the frame and the out of focus blue leafs at the top left make the shot a bit messy i.m.o. 6', '2009-10-01 08:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668965, 824245, 108687, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2009-10-01 08:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668966, 824915, 53200, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph but wish the upper model''s feet weren''t cut off and she didn''t have what looks like "horns" growing out of her head.</td>', 'I like this photograph but wish the upper model''s feet weren''t cut off and she didn''t have what looks like "horns" growing out of her head.', '2009-10-01 08:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668967, 825013, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean shot. Love the colors. A Slightly tighter crop (up and down) may even make it more powerful. Welldone. 7</td>', 'Nice and clean shot. Love the colors. A Slightly tighter crop (up and down) may even make it more powerful. Welldone. 7', '2009-10-01 08:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668970, 824903, 7010, '<td valign="top">A very well executed, unconventional wedding photo. I guess it was a pain to get the lighting right. And you succeeded. 8</td>', 'A very well executed, unconventional wedding photo. I guess it was a pain to get the lighting right. And you succeeded. 8', '2009-10-01 08:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668978, 824793, 7010, '<td valign="top">Hehe... poor beetle... A little too contrasty for me, and I guess you where a little too enthousiastic with sharpening, but I could be wrong on this one.</td>', 'Hehe... poor beetle... A little too contrasty for me, and I guess you where a little too enthousiastic with sharpening, but I could be wrong on this one.', '2009-10-01 08:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668980, 821535, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice! Good capture and lots of energy in this shot. Welldone.</td>', 'Nice! Good capture and lots of energy in this shot. Welldone.', '2009-10-01 08:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668982, 824949, 73942, '<td valign="top">Willard lighthouse South Portland Maine.  I love this area, such a beautiful walk out to the light.  And you''ve caught Portland head light in the background.  Wehre you on a boat?  Looks like a beautiful day, you''ve got a nice sky.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Willard lighthouse South Portland Maine.  I love this area, such a beautiful walk out to the light.  And you''ve caught Portland head light in the background.  Wehre you on a boat?  Looks like a beautiful day, you''ve got a nice sky.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2009-10-01 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668984, 824583, 96574, '<td valign="top">i like the composition of this one. my critiques would be it seems a bit oversaturated and not sure if it''s an illusion but the horizon line looks a bit off.<br/> <br/>6</td>', 'i like the composition of this one. my critiques would be it seems a bit oversaturated and not sure if it''s an illusion but the horizon line looks a bit off. 6', '2009-10-01 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668989, 823890, 7010, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what they''re called in English, but these animals allways make me smile :) My only comment is about the composition: it''s a bit messy and there is no real point of interest to draw the viewers attention to. The head of the one on the foreground left could be the point of interest, but it''s a bit lost in the ''crowd''. Also there isn''t any other animal whos face or other interesting characteristics are prominent. I don''t know if you had the possibility on location, but sometimes it''s rewarding to try lots of different point of views. and above all, with this kind of photography: patience, patience, patience..... (also not one of my best quality''s ;-). 6</td>', 'I don''t know what they''re called in English, but these animals allways make me smile :) My only comment is about the composition: it''s a bit messy and there is no real point of interest to draw the viewers attention to. The head of the one on the foreground left could be the point of interest, but it''s a bit lost in the ''crowd''. Also there isn''t any other animal whos face or other interesting characteristics are prominent. I don''t know if you had the possibility on location, but sometimes it''s rewarding to try lots of different point of views. and above all, with this kind of photography: patience, patience, patience..... (also not one of my best quality''s ;-). 6', '2009-10-01 08:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668993, 824815, 7010, '<td valign="top">Good capture. The coat looks a bit like a cape and brings action into this photo (Is it a bird, a plane? No it''s SuperSheperd! ;-)<br/>I don''t know though about the center position. Maybe it could have been better to crop the pic a bit more and place the man off center. At the other hand, this position also creates a sort of tension that could work. Mmm, difficult...</td>', 'Good capture. The coat looks a bit like a cape and brings action into this photo (Is it a bird, a plane? No it''s SuperSheperd! ;-)I don''t know though about the center position. Maybe it could have been better to crop the pic a bit more and place the man off center. At the other hand, this position also creates a sort of tension that could work. Mmm, difficult...', '2009-10-01 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668994, 824822, 7010, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery and well captured! Great sense of depth. I guess you included the tree to create even more depth, but that doesn''t work in this photo i.m.o. It draws too much attention and pulls the viewer away from the scene. Including foreground objects is  very important in landscape shots, but they should lead the viewer in, instead of out of the scenery. 7</td>', 'Lovely scenery and well captured! Great sense of depth. I guess you included the tree to create even more depth, but that doesn''t work in this photo i.m.o. It draws too much attention and pulls the viewer away from the scene. Including foreground objects is  very important in landscape shots, but they should lead the viewer in, instead of out of the scenery. 7', '2009-10-01 09:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668995, 825042, 23484, '<td valign="top">Wow, this was very nicely done. I love this. 9</td>', 'Wow, this was very nicely done. I love this. 9', '2009-10-01 09:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5668996, 824583, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors. 8</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors. 8', '2009-10-01 09:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
