(5669361, 819045, 99263, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful bird photography. I am sure it''s you Rick as I recognize your trademark style in the lovely clarity and detail and also the way the shot is composed.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful bird photography. I am sure it''s you Rick as I recognize your trademark style in the lovely clarity and detail and also the way the shot is composed.', '2009-10-01 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669370, 824273, 61222, '<td valign="top">OMG I love this shot!! 10</td>', 'OMG I love this shot!! 10', '2009-10-01 12:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669374, 823957, 61222, '<td valign="top">LOL great capture and Clarity</td>', 'LOL great capture and Clarity', '2009-10-01 12:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669376, 819705, 60614, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  I love the combination of natural wood and man made metal rope.  The whole photo is rich in color and the little guy just pops.  Wonderful composition.  I currently have the photo as my background on my work computer.  One of the better grasshopper shots.  Simple but yet has many elments.  Should print this up and frame it.</td>', 'This is awesome.  I love the combination of natural wood and man made metal rope.  The whole photo is rich in color and the little guy just pops.  Wonderful composition.  I currently have the photo as my background on my work computer.  One of the better grasshopper shots.  Simple but yet has many elments.  Should print this up and frame it.', '2009-10-01 12:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669377, 824979, 92296, '<td valign="top">Most of the lighting here is ace.  A bit more light on her hair and a bit less smoke in front of it would work better for me, but I''m just picky. 8</td>', 'Most of the lighting here is ace.  A bit more light on her hair and a bit less smoke in front of it would work better for me, but I''m just picky. 8', '2009-10-01 12:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
