(5669381, 824636, 99412, '<td valign="top">They say a picture is worth a thousands words?.....I''m speechless.......almost.<br/>:)<br/> <br/>If your kids are considering taking drugs....Show em this photo.<br/>:)</td>', 'They say a picture is worth a thousands words?.....I''m speechless.......almost.:) If your kids are considering taking drugs....Show em this photo.:)', '2009-10-01 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
