(5669755, 821908, 31917, '<td valign="top">love the colors</td>', 'love the colors', '2009-10-01 16:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669761, 824559, 96881, '<td valign="top">An interesting place to photograph.  The bright white light thogh draws a lot of attention, an also highlights that most of the light is on the other side of the balloon.  Hence it gives a bit of a feel that I am missing something here, that the balloon is covering up the actions from me.  I do like the positioning of the basket on the right, and the crop of the balloon, which does help balance the image.</td>', 'An interesting place to photograph.  The bright white light thogh draws a lot of attention, an also highlights that most of the light is on the other side of the balloon.  Hence it gives a bit of a feel that I am missing something here, that the balloon is covering up the actions from me.  I do like the positioning of the basket on the right, and the crop of the balloon, which does help balance the image.', '2009-10-01 16:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669762, 824249, 63152, '<td valign="top">I love this one, very well captured, the focus is perfect and the man in the background completes the photo.</td>', 'I love this one, very well captured, the focus is perfect and the man in the background completes the photo.', '2009-10-01 16:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669763, 824551, 96881, '<td valign="top">It seems pretty dark to me already, probably a little too dark (at least on my screen) as I can see some of the detail in the large Telescope, but not a real lot, and I feel with it being a little lighter this could have been really good.  The red lights stand out a little too much at the moment as well.  The left compostion does work well, especially with the red of the su n just disappearing on the right.A little longer on the exposure and this could have been very very good.</td>', 'It seems pretty dark to me already, probably a little too dark (at least on my screen) as I can see some of the detail in the large Telescope, but not a real lot, and I feel with it being a little lighter this could have been really good.  The red lights stand out a little too much at the moment as well.  The left compostion does work well, especially with the red of the su n just disappearing on the right.A little longer on the exposure and this could have been very very good.', '2009-10-01 16:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669768, 823780, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very Regal.  The lion photographed well always looks great.  I have never managed to capture one well, but still trying........The crop is very close at the top, and seeing he is looking up and right, I feel a little more room above the image would have balanced this a little more.  You have given that space right, but not above.</td>', 'Very Regal.  The lion photographed well always looks great.  I have never managed to capture one well, but still trying........The crop is very close at the top, and seeing he is looking up and right, I feel a little more room above the image would have balanced this a little more.  You have given that space right, but not above.', '2009-10-01 16:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669776, 819705, 63152, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colours</td>', 'Great composition and colours', '2009-10-01 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669777, 824783, 7010, '<td valign="top">One of the best bugshots of this challenge!</td>', 'One of the best bugshots of this challenge!', '2009-10-01 16:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669781, 824835, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field here, really making the subject jump out from the background.  The colours ghere are really good, and the composition I feel works really well.</td>', 'Great depth of field here, really making the subject jump out from the background.  The colours ghere are really good, and the composition I feel works really well.', '2009-10-01 16:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669789, 824903, 96881, '<td valign="top">The light here is great, love the way it highlights the features.  However, the break in teh background, where the brioght light is coming in, gives it a seperated, almost broken line through the photo and makes it almost like two halves.  It unfortunately keeps putting this ''broken marriage'' through my head, as it seems like a massive barrier in the image.  Unfortunately, it completely ruins the effect of what otherwise is a great capture...............</td>', 'The light here is great, love the way it highlights the features.  However, the break in teh background, where the brioght light is coming in, gives it a seperated, almost broken line through the photo and makes it almost like two halves.  It unfortunately keeps putting this ''broken marriage'' through my head, as it seems like a massive barrier in the image.  Unfortunately, it completely ruins the effect of what otherwise is a great capture...............', '2009-10-01 16:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669791, 822529, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is a pigeon, is it not?  A very fancy one, but a pigeon just the same!</td>', 'That is a pigeon, is it not?  A very fancy one, but a pigeon just the same!', '2009-10-01 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669792, 825028, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed with excellent foreground elements and a gorgeous reflection.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened but hard to avoid that witha shot like this at 720 pixels.</td>', 'Very nicely composed with excellent foreground elements and a gorgeous reflection.  Perhaps a tad oversharpened but hard to avoid that witha shot like this at 720 pixels.', '2009-10-01 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669794, 824782, 30982, '<td valign="top">If it has plumbing, or at least the possibility of plumbing, I''ll take it.</td>', 'If it has plumbing, or at least the possibility of plumbing, I''ll take it.', '2009-10-01 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669795, 824559, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this not-classic balloon view - the energy of the people involved is fun to see.</td>', 'I like this not-classic balloon view - the energy of the people involved is fun to see.', '2009-10-01 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669797, 825042, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image, a contrast between the old and new, the styles that make up a city.  It does though have a disjointed feel, the different building on different anglles, and the lines dont lead to any focal point at all.</td>', 'A very interesting image, a contrast between the old and new, the styles that make up a city.  It does though have a disjointed feel, the different building on different anglles, and the lines dont lead to any focal point at all.', '2009-10-01 16:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669798, 824514, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good street portrait, in my opinion.  Some will say there are parts washed out or too bright, but it works for me.</td>', 'Good street portrait, in my opinion.  Some will say there are parts washed out or too bright, but it works for me.', '2009-10-01 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669800, 822598, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Looks like a very old prison(?)  I like the composition of being lead down the middle to the end of the long corridor.  I think it looks "balanced on both the right and left with the stairs on the right countered with the open cell door on the left.  Like the choice of B&amp;W to enhance the abandoned "dreary" feel to the image.</td>', 'Interesting image.  Looks like a very old prison(?)  I like the composition of being lead down the middle to the end of the long corridor.  I think it looks "balanced on both the right and left with the stairs on the right countered with the open cell door on the left.  Like the choice of B&W to enhance the abandoned "dreary" feel to the image.', '2009-10-01 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669801, 824238, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to make something with this much detail - and busy detail at that! - work at a DPC size, and yet you have done a marvelous job here.  Really shows off the countryside well.</td>', 'It''s hard to make something with this much detail - and busy detail at that! - work at a DPC size, and yet you have done a marvelous job here.  Really shows off the countryside well.', '2009-10-01 16:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669802, 824873, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very fun!</td>', 'Very fun!', '2009-10-01 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669804, 824516, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Title, Good image.  I like the effect of the long exposures on the water, the almost mystic feel that it goves the overall photo as a result.  Composition is very centered, and the front rocks seem to lead somewhere.  Could an off center sun, and more room to the right have worked?  Just a thought.  A great image and great colours through it as well..........</td>', 'Great Title, Good image.  I like the effect of the long exposures on the water, the almost mystic feel that it goves the overall photo as a result.  Composition is very centered, and the front rocks seem to lead somewhere.  Could an off center sun, and more room to the right have worked?  Just a thought.  A great image and great colours through it as well..........', '2009-10-01 16:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669805, 823957, 7010, '<td valign="top">Not the craftiest photo around, technicaly speaking, but it sure doesn''t need oversaturated colors, special effects, spectacular views or other shiny tricks to get the job done. This image tells a story, and has some very strong elements in it: the dead leaves, the birds. Very nice! 8</td>', 'Not the craftiest photo around, technicaly speaking, but it sure doesn''t need oversaturated colors, special effects, spectacular views or other shiny tricks to get the job done. This image tells a story, and has some very strong elements in it: the dead leaves, the birds. Very nice! 8', '2009-10-01 16:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669808, 824085, 96881, '<td valign="top">A nice crisp capture of the bird.  I like the attempt at the depth of field to make it stand out, however, for me, the dark patches in the water that have resulted from the depth of field and processing have become a distraction</td>', 'A nice crisp capture of the bird.  I like the attempt at the depth of field to make it stand out, however, for me, the dark patches in the water that have resulted from the depth of field and processing have become a distraction', '2009-10-01 16:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669813, 824760, 96881, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure.............<br/>The stairs appear to lead somewhere, but we dont see where.  I feel I am getting a fragment of the scene, and not the full view.  The brown colours lack any real interest to make the scene trully stand out.</td>', 'I''m not sure.............The stairs appear to lead somewhere, but we dont see where.  I feel I am getting a fragment of the scene, and not the full view.  The brown colours lack any real interest to make the scene trully stand out.', '2009-10-01 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
