(5670501, 824979, 67585, '<td valign="top">Nice image and great model.  I like the detail of the ash hanging.  I think it would be improved with a little more room on the left side of the frame.</td>', 'Nice image and great model.  I like the detail of the ash hanging.  I think it would be improved with a little more room on the left side of the frame.', '2009-10-01 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670507, 824231, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I like the centred horizon here, as for me this picture is all about the contrast between they sky and the land with the sun almost belonging to both! My only minor complaint is that the lower half is just a little too dark, just a little though.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I like the centred horizon here, as for me this picture is all about the contrast between they sky and the land with the sun almost belonging to both! My only minor complaint is that the lower half is just a little too dark, just a little though.', '2009-10-01 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670511, 824972, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours, feels a little unearthly!</td>', 'Very nice colours, feels a little unearthly!', '2009-10-01 23:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670514, 824551, 101117, '<td valign="top">Even with my brightness turned right up, this is a little too dark. I think the concept could have been a good one, but I would have liked to see a little more space, or perhaps a little more sky.</td>', 'Even with my brightness turned right up, this is a little too dark. I think the concept could have been a good one, but I would have liked to see a little more space, or perhaps a little more sky.', '2009-10-01 23:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670516, 823698, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but I think in general there''s not much here that captures my attention.</td>', 'Nice colours, but I think in general there''s not much here that captures my attention.', '2009-10-01 23:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670519, 820746, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good sports capture, well composed. Don''t particularly like the border though, and I wonder if this would have looked better in colour.</td>', 'Good sports capture, well composed. Don''t particularly like the border though, and I wonder if this would have looked better in colour.', '2009-10-01 23:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670522, 824831, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a little too over sharpened / overprocessed for my liking. The initial capture is nice but I think you''ve actually taken a lot away from it with the PP.</td>', 'This is a little too over sharpened / overprocessed for my liking. The initial capture is nice but I think you''ve actually taken a lot away from it with the PP.', '2009-10-01 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670526, 824901, 101117, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great location and is a good capture. There''s something not quite right about the colours though, they look a little off and there seems to be a dark band running down the middle from the top to about the halfway point, not sure if it''s a result of processing or a trick of the light but it''s not helping.</td>', 'This looks like a great location and is a good capture. There''s something not quite right about the colours though, they look a little off and there seems to be a dark band running down the middle from the top to about the halfway point, not sure if it''s a result of processing or a trick of the light but it''s not helping.', '2009-10-01 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670535, 824616, 98771, '<td valign="top">From the looks of the saddle, I''d say Austraila. I like it.</td>', 'From the looks of the saddle, I''d say Austraila. I like it.', '2009-10-01 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670537, 823780, 98771, '<td valign="top">It glows! Very nice.</td>', 'It glows! Very nice.', '2009-10-01 23:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
