(5670570, 820642, 79955, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha !! GREAT shot . great moment. I am sure this will do well.<br/>I have a only a minor comment on the noise in the left eye and the blueish hue on the top of the beak , which I would normally selectively edit.<br/>9</td>', 'Ha Ha !! GREAT shot . great moment. I am sure this will do well.I have a only a minor comment on the noise in the left eye and the blueish hue on the top of the beak , which I would normally selectively edit.9', '2009-10-01 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
