(5672355, 824172, 83313, '<td valign="top">Knock, knock... JPEG police here. We have a warrant.<br/> <br/>A great action shot but there is a lot of extra JPEG compression taking away some detail and creating visible artifacts. (It struck me first in the orange area on the head, but they are visible all over, outlining the bird''s body) Your file size is only 47k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.<br/> <br/>I am often the only one anal enough about compression to notice such things, but it jumped right out at me.</td>', 'Knock, knock... JPEG police here. We have a warrant. A great action shot but there is a lot of extra JPEG compression taking away some detail and creating visible artifacts. (It struck me first in the orange area on the head, but they are visible all over, outlining the bird''s body) Your file size is only 47k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits. I am often the only one anal enough about compression to notice such things, but it jumped right out at me.', '2009-10-03 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
