(5672372, 821900, 45475, '<td valign="top">I can see the ''cheeky'' humour in it, but not so sure entering it in a public (not to mention international) contest was the best way to go. Can''t help wondering, what if (and it''s a long shot, but...) what if she stumbled across this image at some point and recognised the scene and herself in it...... Anyways, love the b&amp;w tones, very nice conversion. [no vote]</td>', 'I can see the ''cheeky'' humour in it, but not so sure entering it in a public (not to mention international) contest was the best way to go. Can''t help wondering, what if (and it''s a long shot, but...) what if she stumbled across this image at some point and recognised the scene and herself in it...... Anyways, love the b&w tones, very nice conversion. [no vote]', '2009-10-03 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
