(5672943, 824365, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is almost a very good shot, but there are a couple of things bothering me about it. First is the angle, it feels a bit odd, though that could be more of a rotation thing than the angle of the camera. The other is the extra space on the right and bottom of the shot, I think there''s just a touch too much empty space there.</td>', 'This is almost a very good shot, but there are a couple of things bothering me about it. First is the angle, it feels a bit odd, though that could be more of a rotation thing than the angle of the camera. The other is the extra space on the right and bottom of the shot, I think there''s just a touch too much empty space there.', '2009-10-03 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5672945, 824944, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! This speaks volumes to me as this was the generation before mine, the one I grew up watching and your shot captures the essence of it wonderfully! Giving this my only 10 so far!</td>', 'Great portrait! This speaks volumes to me as this was the generation before mine, the one I grew up watching and your shot captures the essence of it wonderfully! Giving this my only 10 so far!', '2009-10-03 12:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
