(5672948, 824784, 101117, '<td valign="top">The falls are quite nice here, but there are too many other elements in the shot for it to work properly. The people and the lights from the background, detract from what is the main subject. I get that you are giving the falls a sense of context, but it just doesn''t work well together for me I''m afraid.</td>', 'The falls are quite nice here, but there are too many other elements in the shot for it to work properly. The people and the lights from the background, detract from what is the main subject. I get that you are giving the falls a sense of context, but it just doesn''t work well together for me I''m afraid.', '2009-10-03 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
