(5672953, 823935, 101117, '<td valign="top">Really interesting shot, not entirely sure what it is, but it''s very striking. My first impression was that it''s a large eye with a reflection, but I don''t think that''s quite right. Certainly kept me looking for a while, it will be interesting to come back to this once voting''s over to find out what it is!</td>', 'Really interesting shot, not entirely sure what it is, but it''s very striking. My first impression was that it''s a large eye with a reflection, but I don''t think that''s quite right. Certainly kept me looking for a while, it will be interesting to come back to this once voting''s over to find out what it is!', '2009-10-03 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
