(5672991, 824912, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract feel to this with colors that ordinarly I would say are over-saturated but it works here, probably because it accentuates the light. I''m enjoying how you filled the frame too. 8</td>', 'Interesting abstract feel to this with colors that ordinarly I would say are over-saturated but it works here, probably because it accentuates the light. I''m enjoying how you filled the frame too. 8', '2009-10-03 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5672992, 823957, 100831, '<td valign="top">funny title - good eye.</td>', 'funny title - good eye.', '2009-10-03 13:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5672993, 824942, 101117, '<td valign="top">For some reason that I can''t quite figure out, I really like this shot. There''s something a bit unusual about it, but at the same time familiar. I find my eyes wandering around the shot for a while and coming back to the man in red and the two birds in the foreground. There''s nothing outstanding here, yet I''ve been sitting staring at this for about 2 minutes now, very odd!</td>', 'For some reason that I can''t quite figure out, I really like this shot. There''s something a bit unusual about it, but at the same time familiar. I find my eyes wandering around the shot for a while and coming back to the man in red and the two birds in the foreground. There''s nothing outstanding here, yet I''ve been sitting staring at this for about 2 minutes now, very odd!', '2009-10-03 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
