(5673396, 821908, 31456, '<td valign="top">Really? I don''t see the sea, but it may be back there. Maybe a higher-resolution image, where I could see more detail... preferably in a 5:4 format... say, 1280x1024 pixels? Yeah, then I''ll be able to <strike>use it as a wallpaper</strike> err see the sea in the background. K, thanks. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=939305&amp;page=9#5673200" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">10</a></td>', 'Really? I don''t see the sea, but it may be back there. Maybe a higher-resolution image, where I could see more detail... preferably in a 5:4 format... say, 1280x1024 pixels? Yeah, then I''ll be able to use it as a wallpaper err see the sea in the background. K, thanks. 10', '2009-10-03 18:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673413, 819347, 31456, '<td valign="top">Fr fr fr, fr-fr fr fr freestyler! Rock the <strike>microphone</strike> big dirtbike!<br/>Straight from the top of <strike>my dome</strike> the pipe!<br/>Free, fr, fr-fr-fr-fr freestyler! Rock the <strike>microphone</strike> big dirtbike!<br/>Carry on, with the freestyler!<br/> <br/>/Yes, I know it''s not a "pipe", but I couldn''t think of anything better. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=939305&amp;page=9#5673200" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">10</a></td>', 'Fr fr fr, fr-fr fr fr freestyler! Rock the microphone big dirtbike!Straight from the top of my dome the pipe!Free, fr, fr-fr-fr-fr freestyler! Rock the microphone big dirtbike!Carry on, with the freestyler! /Yes, I know it''s not a "pipe", but I couldn''t think of anything better. 10', '2009-10-03 18:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
