(5674068, 822923, 86799, '<td valign="top">Well done.  One of my favorites of the month.  Very evocative, very dreamy.  Big ol'' luxury ride, sliding by in a blur...  The owner would love this, I expect.</td>', 'Well done.  One of my favorites of the month.  Very evocative, very dreamy.  Big ol'' luxury ride, sliding by in a blur...  The owner would love this, I expect.', '2009-10-04 09:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
