(5674204, 824678, 31456, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors in the sky, but the top looks like it has a reflection (like it was shot through a window), and it looks a bit like an overdone HDR in some areas. Again, great color. And composition. And sharpness. 8</td>', 'Lovely colors in the sky, but the top looks like it has a reflection (like it was shot through a window), and it looks a bit like an overdone HDR in some areas. Again, great color. And composition. And sharpness. 8', '2009-10-04 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
