(5674806, 824822, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I''m not sure I would have left the tree on the left in the shot. Nice job. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I''m not sure I would have left the tree on the left in the shot. Nice job. 8', '2009-10-04 20:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
