(5678656, 824508, 63398, '<td valign="top">Wistful &amp; touching......love the composition......7</td>', 'Wistful & touching......love the composition......7', '2009-10-07 15:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678779, 824728, 53200, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - just love it!</td>', 'Gorgeous - just love it!', '2009-10-07 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678780, 824924, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like how his hat creates a sparkle in his eyes by helping direct the light.</td>', 'I like how his hat creates a sparkle in his eyes by helping direct the light.', '2009-10-07 16:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678781, 824793, 53200, '<td valign="top">Really great perspective - what an original idea!!!</td>', 'Really great perspective - what an original idea!!!', '2009-10-07 16:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678783, 824233, 53200, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on the woman''s face - wish the rifle was turned the other way so it didn''t look so much like a stick.  Makes one wonder what the future is in this story.</td>', 'Love the expression on the woman''s face - wish the rifle was turned the other way so it didn''t look so much like a stick.  Makes one wonder what the future is in this story.', '2009-10-07 16:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678784, 822315, 53200, '<td valign="top">This is great - really does look like a piece of fine art - I''m just not fond of the blue frames but I guess that''s the color of the building and there''s not much you could do about that - only MPO - good luck!</td>', 'This is great - really does look like a piece of fine art - I''m just not fond of the blue frames but I guess that''s the color of the building and there''s not much you could do about that - only MPO - good luck!', '2009-10-07 16:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678785, 824600, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the calm before the storm feeling of this.</td>', 'Love the composition and the calm before the storm feeling of this.', '2009-10-07 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678788, 825035, 53200, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful shot!!!</td>', 'What a wonderful shot!!!', '2009-10-07 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678790, 824516, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great composition and vibrant colour.</td>', 'Great composition and vibrant colour.', '2009-10-07 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678792, 824172, 53200, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2009-10-07 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678793, 823401, 53200, '<td valign="top">Great shot - really crisp - love it!!</td>', 'Great shot - really crisp - love it!!', '2009-10-07 16:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678794, 825049, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail - its a pretty scruffy creature, but the title perfectly describes the expression.</td>', 'Lovely detail - its a pretty scruffy creature, but the title perfectly describes the expression.', '2009-10-07 16:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678796, 823356, 44611, '<td valign="top">I just love the luminescence of this.  Great macro.</td>', 'I just love the luminescence of this.  Great macro.', '2009-10-07 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678799, 823780, 44611, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot .. such marvellous detail and perfect lighting.</td>', 'Stunning shot .. such marvellous detail and perfect lighting.', '2009-10-07 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678804, 825050, 42013, '<td valign="top">Another nice one Raj--like the sweeping ''s'' shape with all of the various rock forms.</td>', 'Another nice one Raj--like the sweeping ''s'' shape with all of the various rock forms.', '2009-10-07 16:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678808, 822457, 53200, '<td valign="top">I think I would have enjoyed this more if the light was more delicate and you got rid of the buds and leaves cause they don''t seem to add anything to your photo.  Re-reading my comment - I hope you don''t take it too personally - This is just my opinion - I didn''t mean to sound so harsh.</td>', 'I think I would have enjoyed this more if the light was more delicate and you got rid of the buds and leaves cause they don''t seem to add anything to your photo.  Re-reading my comment - I hope you don''t take it too personally - This is just my opinion - I didn''t mean to sound so harsh.', '2009-10-07 16:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678814, 823826, 61961, '<td valign="top">Except for the man''s costume, could be a still from a film by Carl Th. Dreyer.  My favorite entry in the Free Study so far.</td>', 'Except for the man''s costume, could be a still from a film by Carl Th. Dreyer.  My favorite entry in the Free Study so far.', '2009-10-07 16:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678819, 819209, 53200, '<td valign="top">What a shot - pays to be in the right place at the right time!!!</td>', 'What a shot - pays to be in the right place at the right time!!!', '2009-10-07 16:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678906, 819834, 56502, '<td valign="top">I must admit that I didn''t really understand what this is intending to tell me.</td>', 'I must admit that I didn''t really understand what this is intending to tell me.', '2009-10-07 17:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678913, 824979, 74911, '<td valign="top">Brilliant work on the lighting. Very professional. I wish I can get this better on lighting. Great expressions from the model. Good pose and nice makeover. Marking this favorite <strike>and giving a 9. Why 9? The smoke in front of her lips is bothering a bit.</strike>. <br/> <br/>Bumping this to 10. Not because I see some "Larus" in this :). After attempting to take some portraits with my son using off-camera flash, I realized how much efforts and expertise it takes to get this quality of lighting. So why this 10. Great work.<br/> <br/>Raj<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-08 10:33:30.</i></td>', 'Brilliant work on the lighting. Very professional. I wish I can get this better on lighting. Great expressions from the model. Good pose and nice makeover. Marking this favorite and giving a 9. Why 9? The smoke in front of her lips is bothering a bit..  Bumping this to 10. Not because I see some "Larus" in this :). After attempting to take some portraits with my son using off-camera flash, I realized how much efforts and expertise it takes to get this quality of lighting. So why this 10. Great work. Raj', '2009-10-07 17:21:19.000000', '2009-10-08 11:33:30.000000', 1),
(5678929, 824471, 33182, '<td valign="top">Oookay. My eyes are playing tricks on me with this. Cool.</td>', 'Oookay. My eyes are playing tricks on me with this. Cool.', '2009-10-07 17:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678943, 824750, 33182, '<td valign="top">I would think that the axe would damage the felt.</td>', 'I would think that the axe would damage the felt.', '2009-10-07 17:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678962, 821855, 33182, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see what the story behind this is.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see what the story behind this is.', '2009-10-07 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678971, 823748, 33182, '<td valign="top">Never would have thought of doing a negative like this. Interesting.</td>', 'Never would have thought of doing a negative like this. Interesting.', '2009-10-07 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678972, 824734, 33182, '<td valign="top">It''s like a big eye looking at me.</td>', 'It''s like a big eye looking at me.', '2009-10-07 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678975, 823935, 33182, '<td valign="top">Looks like some lizard monster''s eye or something.</td>', 'Looks like some lizard monster''s eye or something.', '2009-10-07 17:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678990, 820490, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great seasonal still life. The natural lighting and DOF and rustic colors all work well.</td>', 'Great seasonal still life. The natural lighting and DOF and rustic colors all work well.', '2009-10-07 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678994, 824711, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little too sharp around the arch formation maybe -- the haloing catches my eye. Otherwise, great!</td>', 'A little too sharp around the arch formation maybe -- the haloing catches my eye. Otherwise, great!', '2009-10-07 17:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5678999, 824169, 76335, '<td valign="top">Contrast feels a little flat.</td>', 'Contrast feels a little flat.', '2009-10-07 17:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679009, 821824, 33182, '<td valign="top">What the heck is this!?!?!?!?!?!?!</td>', 'What the heck is this!?!?!?!?!?!?!', '2009-10-07 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679014, 824354, 92545, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  I wish I could vote, (not a member).  I can''t wait to read your comments when this challenge is over.  I want to know where this was taken.<br/> <br/>Edit:  now I know where it was taken.  I''m from the states, but took a trip to England and Scotland 6 or 7 years ago.  The most breathtaking beauty I recall from the entire trip was Glen Coe.  I loved it during the challenge and I love it even more now.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-09 14:40:24.</i></td>', 'Wow!!!  I wish I could vote, (not a member).  I can''t wait to read your comments when this challenge is over.  I want to know where this was taken. Edit:  now I know where it was taken.  I''m from the states, but took a trip to England and Scotland 6 or 7 years ago.  The most breathtaking beauty I recall from the entire trip was Glen Coe.  I loved it during the challenge and I love it even more now.', '2009-10-07 17:55:13.000000', '2009-10-09 15:40:24.000000', 1),
(5679045, 823752, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stunning lighting.</td>', 'Stunning lighting.', '2009-10-07 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679047, 820905, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lensbaby? Can''t tell. Maybe really shallow DOF. In any case, would like to see the horse''s head more in focus.</td>', 'Lensbaby? Can''t tell. Maybe really shallow DOF. In any case, would like to see the horse''s head more in focus.', '2009-10-07 18:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679050, 824966, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting.</td>', 'Very effective lighting.', '2009-10-07 18:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679051, 824840, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great stolen moment. The grain works well.</td>', 'Great stolen moment. The grain works well.', '2009-10-07 18:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679052, 820761, 92545, '<td valign="top">Is it really?  That is an incredible work of art.  The photo is great, but the leaf sculpture is ASTOUNDING!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Is it really?  That is an incredible work of art.  The photo is great, but the leaf sculpture is ASTOUNDING!!!!!!!!!', '2009-10-07 18:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679054, 820713, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a bit harsh.</td>', 'Lighting''s a bit harsh.', '2009-10-07 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679056, 824942, 76335, '<td valign="top">Kind of a mundane scene -- not much happening.</td>', 'Kind of a mundane scene -- not much happening.', '2009-10-07 18:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679061, 824837, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice pose. Would like to see some more textures and maybe contrast.</td>', 'Nice pose. Would like to see some more textures and maybe contrast.', '2009-10-07 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679062, 824249, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2009-10-07 18:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679064, 824781, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great colors. There''s some subtle radial geometry here that really pulls the eye in.</td>', 'Great colors. There''s some subtle radial geometry here that really pulls the eye in.', '2009-10-07 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679067, 824869, 76335, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped the overexposed bank out of the picture.</td>', 'I might have cropped the overexposed bank out of the picture.', '2009-10-07 18:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679069, 824761, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ribbon! (Or damn close to it.)</td>', 'Ribbon! (Or damn close to it.)', '2009-10-07 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679070, 825058, 76335, '<td valign="top">Crawling right out of the frame, it looks like. Great lighting here.</td>', 'Crawling right out of the frame, it looks like. Great lighting here.', '2009-10-07 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679071, 824822, 76335, '<td valign="top">Those cool green pastel colors are wonderful.</td>', 'Those cool green pastel colors are wonderful.', '2009-10-07 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679072, 819834, 76335, '<td valign="top">Movie set or extreme photojournalism? Great, either way.</td>', 'Movie set or extreme photojournalism? Great, either way.', '2009-10-07 18:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679175, 824990, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not a very relaxed or natural pose...</td>', 'Not a very relaxed or natural pose...', '2009-10-07 20:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679176, 824447, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great carefree candid feel.</td>', 'Great carefree candid feel.', '2009-10-07 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679179, 824434, 36914, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus lighting is great too.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus lighting is great too.', '2009-10-07 20:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679182, 824793, 76335, '<td valign="top">I hope no beatles were hurt in the making of this photograph. Ha! Quite a moment.</td>', 'I hope no beatles were hurt in the making of this photograph. Ha! Quite a moment.', '2009-10-07 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679185, 824551, 76335, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really work in silhouette; the observatory looms too large. Maybe a little more detail in the shadows?</td>', 'Doesn''t really work in silhouette; the observatory looms too large. Maybe a little more detail in the shadows?', '2009-10-07 20:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679186, 824581, 36914, '<td valign="top">Kind of loose the subject being back so far, maybe a tighter crop.</td>', 'Kind of loose the subject being back so far, maybe a tighter crop.', '2009-10-07 20:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679187, 824806, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think either go all silhouette are allow more detail in the shadows.</td>', 'I think either go all silhouette are allow more detail in the shadows.', '2009-10-07 20:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679190, 824627, 76335, '<td valign="top">I know who this is! Good candid.</td>', 'I know who this is! Good candid.', '2009-10-07 20:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679192, 825065, 76335, '<td valign="top">Still life? Photojournalism? Seems to defy category. I love the sterile nature of this and the tilt just nails it. Great!</td>', 'Still life? Photojournalism? Seems to defy category. I love the sterile nature of this and the tilt just nails it. Great!', '2009-10-07 20:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679195, 824232, 36914, '<td valign="top">Needs focus, over sharpened</td>', 'Needs focus, over sharpened', '2009-10-07 20:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679196, 824276, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quite grainy. The colors suggest a martian landscape. Jury''s out for me on this one. A six anyway.</td>', 'Quite grainy. The colors suggest a martian landscape. Jury''s out for me on this one. A six anyway.', '2009-10-07 20:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679231, 824447, 108687, '<td valign="top">Real nice portrait.</td>', 'Real nice portrait.', '2009-10-07 21:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679234, 824964, 108687, '<td valign="top">The large flair over his eye is distracting.</td>', 'The large flair over his eye is distracting.', '2009-10-07 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679237, 822180, 108687, '<td valign="top">I love the limited DOF here.</td>', 'I love the limited DOF here.', '2009-10-07 21:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679238, 820713, 108687, '<td valign="top">A little too overexposed for me.</td>', 'A little too overexposed for me.', '2009-10-07 21:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679239, 822535, 108687, '<td valign="top">Wow....</td>', 'Wow....', '2009-10-07 21:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679247, 823029, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one just made me smile. Thanks for the chuckle. A minor critique, though. You should use the maximum entry size of 640 or 720 pixels on at least one side. No sense in throwing away detail you don''t have to.</td>', 'This one just made me smile. Thanks for the chuckle. A minor critique, though. You should use the maximum entry size of 640 or 720 pixels on at least one side. No sense in throwing away detail you don''t have to.', '2009-10-07 21:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679249, 821855, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like steampunk. Very cool.</td>', 'I like steampunk. Very cool.', '2009-10-07 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679250, 820761, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful fractal image. Great background too.</td>', 'Wonderful fractal image. Great background too.', '2009-10-07 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679255, 821868, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot but wish it were bigger.</td>', 'I like it a lot but wish it were bigger.', '2009-10-07 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679256, 825013, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the layers of color. Very artistic.</td>', 'I like the layers of color. Very artistic.', '2009-10-07 21:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679257, 824955, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good honest moment. I might have cleaned the mirror or cropped the dirt marks out.</td>', 'Good honest moment. I might have cleaned the mirror or cropped the dirt marks out.', '2009-10-07 21:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679259, 823486, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very painterly, well composed.</td>', 'Very painterly, well composed.', '2009-10-07 21:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679261, 823826, 83313, '<td valign="top">From the subject, I am guessing this may be from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=28322" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AmeedEl-Ghoul</a>. A nice variation on your usual strong colors. Very moody.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-08 00:19:05.</i></td>', 'From the subject, I am guessing this may be from  AmeedEl-Ghoul. A nice variation on your usual strong colors. Very moody.', '2009-10-07 21:15:11.000000', '2009-10-08 01:19:05.000000', 1),
(5679262, 824868, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous display of raw, untamed energy.</td>', 'Fabulous display of raw, untamed energy.', '2009-10-07 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679263, 824914, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, interesting angle.</td>', 'Nice tones, interesting angle.', '2009-10-07 21:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679264, 820057, 30861, '<td valign="top">Ah, this is OUTstanding! Probably doomed, but a thumbs-up from me.</td>', 'Ah, this is OUTstanding! Probably doomed, but a thumbs-up from me.', '2009-10-07 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679265, 823624, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s no shame in flare! And this is a nice display of it.</td>', 'There''s no shame in flare! And this is a nice display of it.', '2009-10-07 21:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679266, 824000, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s no real focal point that I can see. The tree is chopped off and mostly in the shadows anyway; the house (?) is too far away.</td>', 'There''s no real focal point that I can see. The tree is chopped off and mostly in the shadows anyway; the house (?) is too far away.', '2009-10-07 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679267, 825042, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; I love shots like this. A few nitpicks: the building on the right doesn''t add much and could probably be cropped out (it''s mostly in the shadows anyway). Also, the lighting seems a bit harsh. Not knowing this location, I wonder if shooting earlier or later in the day was a possibility. Six.</td>', 'Nice idea; I love shots like this. A few nitpicks: the building on the right doesn''t add much and could probably be cropped out (it''s mostly in the shadows anyway). Also, the lighting seems a bit harsh. Not knowing this location, I wonder if shooting earlier or later in the day was a possibility. Six.', '2009-10-07 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679268, 824903, 76335, '<td valign="top">They''ll love it.</td>', 'They''ll love it.', '2009-10-07 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1);
