(5679315, 820313, 83313, '<td valign="top">Don''t yu hat when u misspell a tytel and don c it until avter trollover? <br/> <br/>On the other hand, perhaps these are the Chick-fil-a cows that are always encouraging us to "eat mor chikin".</td>', 'Don''t yu hat when u misspell a tytel and don c it until avter trollover?  On the other hand, perhaps these are the Chick-fil-a cows that are always encouraging us to "eat mor chikin".', '2009-10-07 21:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679317, 823712, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a big-headed cartoon character.</td>', 'Looks like a big-headed cartoon character.', '2009-10-07 21:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679322, 824495, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like these sort of shots. I think of them as semi-abstract. You can readily tell what they are, but they are photographed in an abstract manner.</td>', 'I like these sort of shots. I think of them as semi-abstract. You can readily tell what they are, but they are photographed in an abstract manner.', '2009-10-07 22:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679341, 824943, 6306, '<td valign="top">totally badass. nice job.</td>', 'totally badass. nice job.', '2009-10-07 22:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679343, 824659, 6306, '<td valign="top">gorgeous.</td>', 'gorgeous.', '2009-10-07 22:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679344, 824893, 6306, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture.</td>', 'beautiful capture.', '2009-10-07 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679345, 823401, 6306, '<td valign="top">best bald eagle portrait i''ve seen in a while. no blown highlights, good focus. not really unique though, so it''s a 9</td>', 'best bald eagle portrait i''ve seen in a while. no blown highlights, good focus. not really unique though, so it''s a 9', '2009-10-07 22:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679346, 823249, 6306, '<td valign="top">i love the processing. well done.</td>', 'i love the processing. well done.', '2009-10-07 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679347, 823207, 6306, '<td valign="top">centered works well here. nice portrait.</td>', 'centered works well here. nice portrait.', '2009-10-07 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679348, 824245, 6306, '<td valign="top">i love the minimalism in this. nice job.</td>', 'i love the minimalism in this. nice job.', '2009-10-07 22:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679349, 824495, 6306, '<td valign="top">simple, beautiful work.</td>', 'simple, beautiful work.', '2009-10-07 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679350, 824419, 6306, '<td valign="top">looks like a faded polaroid. great work.</td>', 'looks like a faded polaroid. great work.', '2009-10-07 22:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679353, 822875, 6306, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2009-10-07 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679356, 823803, 6306, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2009-10-07 22:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679357, 824097, 65234, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t planning on voting this FS but I popped in and saw this and had to vote and make it count.  Wonderful image of a toddler''s curiousity, showing her confidently (if maybe a little unsteadily) exploring her world.</td>', 'I wasn''t planning on voting this FS but I popped in and saw this and had to vote and make it count.  Wonderful image of a toddler''s curiousity, showing her confidently (if maybe a little unsteadily) exploring her world.', '2009-10-07 22:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679359, 825041, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love those ripples in the sand that catch the light so well, and the bits of driftwood that invite exploration, and maybe some imagining of pirate ships and deserted beaches.</td>', 'I love those ripples in the sand that catch the light so well, and the bits of driftwood that invite exploration, and maybe some imagining of pirate ships and deserted beaches.', '2009-10-07 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679366, 824942, 65234, '<td valign="top">He seems so purposeful compared to everyone else.  Not that he''s in a business suit or anything, but something about his pose says he''s on his way to do something specific, while everyone else seems to be lazing about as people on vacation at the beach tend to do.  Love the pastels in the sand and water and sky ... really painterly look, but not so far from a photograph as to seem overprocessed.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'He seems so purposeful compared to everyone else.  Not that he''s in a business suit or anything, but something about his pose says he''s on his way to do something specific, while everyone else seems to be lazing about as people on vacation at the beach tend to do.  Love the pastels in the sand and water and sky ... really painterly look, but not so far from a photograph as to seem overprocessed.  I like this a lot.', '2009-10-07 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679368, 821883, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and very touching.  The light is really pretty and I love the detail in theur eyes and faces.</td>', 'This is beautiful and very touching.  The light is really pretty and I love the detail in theur eyes and faces.', '2009-10-07 22:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679370, 822598, 76335, '<td valign="top">Faulous study in natural light and textures.</td>', 'Faulous study in natural light and textures.', '2009-10-07 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679371, 824915, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is surreal and bizarre and ... very, very well done!</td>', 'This is surreal and bizarre and ... very, very well done!', '2009-10-07 22:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679372, 824991, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail; sharp, as a raptor''s eye should be.</td>', 'Beautiful detail; sharp, as a raptor''s eye should be.', '2009-10-07 22:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679373, 822154, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. A good strong theme.</td>', 'Nicely done. A good strong theme.', '2009-10-07 22:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679374, 824962, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastels and I like the sparkle in the sand.  Generally not a big fan of centered compositions but I think it works here, at least partly because the shadow and seashell add some asymmetry I like.</td>', 'Lovely pastels and I like the sparkle in the sand.  Generally not a big fan of centered compositions but I think it works here, at least partly because the shadow and seashell add some asymmetry I like.', '2009-10-07 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679376, 824754, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good strong geometry. (Iraklis?)</td>', 'Nicely composed, good strong geometry. (Iraklis?)', '2009-10-07 22:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679377, 824952, 65234, '<td valign="top">You really nailed the focus on this one!  Nice detail and the apparent eye contact is terrific.</td>', 'You really nailed the focus on this one!  Nice detail and the apparent eye contact is terrific.', '2009-10-07 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679380, 821855, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one just has my imagination running all over the place; what a cool subject!  The misty/dusty/foggy background makes me feel like I''m seeing a ghost of something.</td>', 'This one just has my imagination running all over the place; what a cool subject!  The misty/dusty/foggy background makes me feel like I''m seeing a ghost of something.', '2009-10-07 22:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679381, 821510, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the ironic title.</td>', 'I like the ironic title.', '2009-10-07 22:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679382, 824948, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and color, and I like the angle of the branches and bird.</td>', 'Lovely detail and color, and I like the angle of the branches and bird.', '2009-10-07 22:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679385, 824495, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very effectively composed.</td>', 'Very effectively composed.', '2009-10-07 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679386, 823144, 65234, '<td valign="top">And what an interesting thing he has to pose on :-)  Absolutely love the perspective and DOF here; very well done!</td>', 'And what an interesting thing he has to pose on :-)  Absolutely love the perspective and DOF here; very well done!', '2009-10-07 22:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679388, 825050, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene with soft colors and nice detail in the rocks.</td>', 'Very pretty scene with soft colors and nice detail in the rocks.', '2009-10-07 22:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679392, 823792, 65234, '<td valign="top">Getting the lightning and buildings in such detail AND starbursts on the lamps ... nicely done!</td>', 'Getting the lightning and buildings in such detail AND starbursts on the lamps ... nicely done!', '2009-10-07 22:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679395, 823356, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2009-10-07 22:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679397, 823569, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous job on the exposure here; the colors stand out beautifully and sharply against the dark sky.</td>', 'Fabulous job on the exposure here; the colors stand out beautifully and sharply against the dark sky.', '2009-10-07 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679400, 823456, 76335, '<td valign="top">Best flower shot I''ve seen so far. Works so well in black and white.</td>', 'Best flower shot I''ve seen so far. Works so well in black and white.', '2009-10-07 22:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679403, 820642, 65234, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the smile :-)  This one''s a keeper!</td>', 'Thanks for the smile :-)  This one''s a keeper!', '2009-10-07 22:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679405, 824516, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty; I think the light on the rocks is my favorite part.</td>', 'Very pretty; I think the light on the rocks is my favorite part.', '2009-10-07 22:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679407, 824983, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t like spiders ... but dang, this is a cool shot!</td>', 'I don''t like spiders ... but dang, this is a cool shot!', '2009-10-07 22:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679410, 825058, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fabulous detail on that eye!</td>', 'Fabulous detail on that eye!', '2009-10-07 22:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679411, 819358, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting effect; I like it.</td>', 'This is a really interesting effect; I like it.', '2009-10-07 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679412, 823956, 76335, '<td valign="top">Most baby shots look alike to me after a while, but this really works. The framing is right on, and the simplicity of the lighting and the background are very effective.</td>', 'Most baby shots look alike to me after a while, but this really works. The framing is right on, and the simplicity of the lighting and the background are very effective.', '2009-10-07 22:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679414, 824875, 76335, '<td valign="top">A humorous and fascinating character study.</td>', 'A humorous and fascinating character study.', '2009-10-07 22:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679416, 825037, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love high key, but this borders on over the top. Needs a little more definition, contrast.</td>', 'I love high key, but this borders on over the top. Needs a little more definition, contrast.', '2009-10-07 22:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679417, 824795, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and I love the pastel peach of the sky.</td>', 'Very nicely composed and I love the pastel peach of the sky.', '2009-10-07 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679418, 823396, 108687, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the low key look.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the low key look.', '2009-10-07 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679419, 822923, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love blur and abstract shots, but there''s nothing here to really anchor the eye. It''s mostly chaotic -- needs some focal point or theme... or something.</td>', 'I love blur and abstract shots, but there''s nothing here to really anchor the eye. It''s mostly chaotic -- needs some focal point or theme... or something.', '2009-10-07 22:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679420, 824802, 65234, '<td valign="top">I am jealous of anyone who gets to see such a scene, nevermind photograph it.  It''s like that Mountain Goat is turning around to ask if you''re still following him!</td>', 'I am jealous of anyone who gets to see such a scene, nevermind photograph it.  It''s like that Mountain Goat is turning around to ask if you''re still following him!', '2009-10-07 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679421, 824955, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can hear her giggling :-)</td>', 'I can hear her giggling :-)', '2009-10-07 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679423, 820636, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect!!</td>', 'Very cool effect!!', '2009-10-07 22:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679424, 821847, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good. I''m curious to hear the story behind this one.</td>', 'Good. I''m curious to hear the story behind this one.', '2009-10-07 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679426, 824762, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cocky little Sparrows!  I love the motion of the incoming birds and the apparent yelling from the perched bird to "go away!"</td>', 'Cocky little Sparrows!  I love the motion of the incoming birds and the apparent yelling from the perched bird to "go away!"', '2009-10-07 22:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679430, 824362, 65234, '<td valign="top">Popular subject in this FS, but this is my favorite.  The composition just really works well for me.</td>', 'Popular subject in this FS, but this is my favorite.  The composition just really works well for me.', '2009-10-07 22:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679431, 821862, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool ''shrooms!!</td>', 'Cool ''shrooms!!', '2009-10-07 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679432, 819757, 76335, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure about the background, but this is growing on me. Gives it some context (the city) without being overbearing. The colors are beautiful.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure about the background, but this is growing on me. Gives it some context (the city) without being overbearing. The colors are beautiful.', '2009-10-07 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679434, 824233, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could have been taken in 1860!</td>', 'Looks like it could have been taken in 1860!', '2009-10-07 22:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679435, 825023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Effective in its simplicity. Nice tones too.</td>', 'Effective in its simplicity. Nice tones too.', '2009-10-07 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679436, 824403, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very pretty light and detail.</td>', 'Very pretty light and detail.', '2009-10-07 22:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679438, 823935, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good experimental work. Nice textures and contrast.</td>', 'Good experimental work. Nice textures and contrast.', '2009-10-07 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679440, 822987, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely curvy shoreline leading me into the scene; like the point of view and detail.</td>', 'Nicely curvy shoreline leading me into the scene; like the point of view and detail.', '2009-10-07 23:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679441, 824937, 76335, '<td valign="top">Is it me or is it leaning slightly to the right? Nice lighting and colors here.</td>', 'Is it me or is it leaning slightly to the right? Nice lighting and colors here.', '2009-10-07 23:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679442, 824987, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and very sweet.</td>', 'Beautiful and very sweet.', '2009-10-07 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679444, 823981, 76335, '<td valign="top">The border is too much. Interesting cityscape though.</td>', 'The border is too much. Interesting cityscape though.', '2009-10-07 23:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679445, 824884, 76335, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that. Still very good.</td>', 'Been there, done that. Still very good.', '2009-10-07 23:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679448, 820642, 76335, '<td valign="top">Finally -- an original owl shot. Very nice.</td>', 'Finally -- an original owl shot. Very nice.', '2009-10-07 23:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679450, 824944, 76335, '<td valign="top">Humorous portrait. I can''t wait to read about it.</td>', 'Humorous portrait. I can''t wait to read about it.', '2009-10-07 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679452, 824185, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fractal-licious!</td>', 'Fractal-licious!', '2009-10-07 23:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679454, 822442, 65234, '<td valign="top">Is that a Tree Swallow?  Interesting birds to watch.  Whites look a bit overexposed on my screen and there are some red pixels in amongst the blue feathers.  I might colorize or touch up those to blend them in; color noise reduction would be another option but I think it might blur the whole bird too much.</td>', 'Is that a Tree Swallow?  Interesting birds to watch.  Whites look a bit overexposed on my screen and there are some red pixels in amongst the blue feathers.  I might colorize or touch up those to blend them in; color noise reduction would be another option but I think it might blur the whole bird too much.', '2009-10-07 23:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679456, 824419, 76335, '<td valign="top">Evokes the sixties or some earlier time. I''ll be curious to read about your set-up/processing. Great.</td>', 'Evokes the sixties or some earlier time. I''ll be curious to read about your set-up/processing. Great.', '2009-10-07 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679457, 824960, 76335, '<td valign="top">Otherworldly. Very original. Great.</td>', 'Otherworldly. Very original. Great.', '2009-10-07 23:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679458, 824843, 76335, '<td valign="top">Deeply troubling. I love it!</td>', 'Deeply troubling. I love it!', '2009-10-07 23:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679459, 824068, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those are pretty!</td>', 'Those are pretty!', '2009-10-07 23:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679460, 823320, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like something out of a fairy tale. Just great!</td>', 'Like something out of a fairy tale. Just great!', '2009-10-07 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679462, 824869, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the rushing water patterns.  The rocks and such look a bit too bright.</td>', 'I like the rushing water patterns.  The rocks and such look a bit too bright.', '2009-10-07 23:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679464, 824961, 76335, '<td valign="top">My single pick of the challenge. A ten for you -- something I rarely hand out.</td>', 'My single pick of the challenge. A ten for you -- something I rarely hand out.', '2009-10-07 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5679470, 824758, 76335, '<td valign="top">The Topaz effect is WAY over the top. I''m sure others will love it. That aside, it''s a wonderfully fun moment.</td>', 'The Topaz effect is WAY over the top. I''m sure others will love it. That aside, it''s a wonderfully fun moment.', '2009-10-07 23:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
