(5679691, 824875, 62357, '<td valign="top">I thought this was one of the most interesting images in this month''s free study.  I scored it pretty highly.  Kudos to you for having the guts to show what life really can be like for many people.  Paul''s comments below hit the nail on the head really.  Well done.  I''m not surprised it didn''t score higher here on DPC, but it is surely a wonderful piece of documentary photography.</td>', 'I thought this was one of the most interesting images in this month''s free study.  I scored it pretty highly.  Kudos to you for having the guts to show what life really can be like for many people.  Paul''s comments below hit the nail on the head really.  Well done.  I''m not surprised it didn''t score higher here on DPC, but it is surely a wonderful piece of documentary photography.', '2009-10-08 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
