(5679704, 824870, 48389, '<td valign="top">So glad this climbed for you Sarah, great score! :-) Thanks for the lovely few days break :-) Think this is one of my favourite spots in the Lakes and there are so many things I wont to take photos of one days! And if I could walk round it that would be lovely...but might take me a few days lol</td>', 'So glad this climbed for you Sarah, great score! :-) Thanks for the lovely few days break :-) Think this is one of my favourite spots in the Lakes and there are so many things I wont to take photos of one days! And if I could walk round it that would be lovely...but might take me a few days lol', '2009-10-08 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679708, 819829, 98171, '<td valign="top">wow...awesome photo and story</td>', 'wow...awesome photo and story', '2009-10-08 01:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679710, 823624, 48389, '<td valign="top">So glad this climbed a bit more for you Deb, hang in there...you''re a GREAT photographer but, just as I love my negative space shots (which don''t always go down well here) you have a still which you enjoy and which I am sure at times will see you getting some cracking scores! {{HUGS}} :-)</td>', 'So glad this climbed a bit more for you Deb, hang in there...you''re a GREAT photographer but, just as I love my negative space shots (which don''t always go down well here) you have a still which you enjoy and which I am sure at times will see you getting some cracking scores! {{HUGS}} :-)', '2009-10-08 01:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679711, 822234, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t even realize you were on DPC until I was reviewing the freestudy results and saw a screenname I knew from the Metro group. Nice going on this one. As you''ve found, freestudies are tough.</td>', 'Didn''t even realize you were on DPC until I was reviewing the freestudy results and saw a screenname I knew from the Metro group. Nice going on this one. As you''ve found, freestudies are tough.', '2009-10-08 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
