(5679727, 824277, 54645, '<td valign="top">Absolutely breathtaking.</td>', 'Absolutely breathtaking.', '2009-10-08 01:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679729, 824238, 84668, '<td valign="top">I think it lacks a clear point of interest. I like it more without the village, maybe you should have cropped it out. Also being a landscape with the sky on it, a more dramatic sky with detailed clouds would make it score higher, I guess. I''m curious to see a version of the same photo without the village and a darker look.<br/>Free Studies are tough anyway(and I still insanely insist on participating on them).</td>', 'I think it lacks a clear point of interest. I like it more without the village, maybe you should have cropped it out. Also being a landscape with the sky on it, a more dramatic sky with detailed clouds would make it score higher, I guess. I''m curious to see a version of the same photo without the village and a darker look.Free Studies are tough anyway(and I still insanely insist on participating on them).', '2009-10-08 01:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679730, 824957, 83313, '<td valign="top">I meant to leave a comment on this during the challenge, but was distracted and forgot. Looks like there is some story here. Is this a truck she is getting out of? Suggests to me she was hitchhiking across the country and has just arrived at her home for the evening,</td>', 'I meant to leave a comment on this during the challenge, but was distracted and forgot. Looks like there is some story here. Is this a truck she is getting out of? Suggests to me she was hitchhiking across the country and has just arrived at her home for the evening,', '2009-10-08 01:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679735, 821535, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the high finish. Enchanting is a good description.</td>', 'Congrats on the high finish. Enchanting is a good description.', '2009-10-08 01:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679736, 824568, 62357, '<td valign="top">T, our score profiles are very similar :)  That''s weird.  I didn''t get any 1,2 or 10 votes either and also got 3 9s. I really expected this to score higher, but well done anyway, it''s still a decent score.  Although must be a downer after the big high score of the other Derwentwater pic. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-08 00:37:04.</i></td>', 'T, our score profiles are very similar :)  That''s weird.  I didn''t get any 1,2 or 10 votes either and also got 3 9s. I really expected this to score higher, but well done anyway, it''s still a decent score.  Although must be a downer after the big high score of the other Derwentwater pic. ', '2009-10-08 01:36:04.000000', '2009-10-08 01:37:04.000000', 0),
(5679737, 823624, 58728, '<td valign="top">You are, have been, and always will be, one of my faves.  This picture is perfect, IMHO.  Please keep sharing your brilliance with us.  You have a true talent, and you inspire me.  So there.  You have to keep shooting, and sharing.  Because without your inspiration, I might cry.  :)</td>', 'You are, have been, and always will be, one of my faves.  This picture is perfect, IMHO.  Please keep sharing your brilliance with us.  You have a true talent, and you inspire me.  So there.  You have to keep shooting, and sharing.  Because without your inspiration, I might cry.  :)', '2009-10-08 01:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679740, 819358, 83313, '<td valign="top">Way underrated, IMO, but then my vote was one of your 9''s. I see you got a coveted Paulbtlw comment. Nice work all around.</td>', 'Way underrated, IMO, but then my vote was one of your 9''s. I see you got a coveted Paulbtlw comment. Nice work all around.', '2009-10-08 01:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
