(5679742, 824277, 33068, '<td valign="top">Congrats Steve on your top 10 finish.   Beautiful image and excellent pov.   Well done!</td>', 'Congrats Steve on your top 10 finish.   Beautiful image and excellent pov.   Well done!', '2009-10-08 01:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679744, 823624, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great immediacy.  My first impression of the force of light, how it almost passes through the little girl and her red jacket;  and of how soon this moment will be gone.  About the tilt and possible stumble of a very young girl on the cobblestones in a very old city.  She is the centre, this is her moment, precarious.</td>', 'Great immediacy.  My first impression of the force of light, how it almost passes through the little girl and her red jacket;  and of how soon this moment will be gone.  About the tilt and possible stumble of a very young girl on the cobblestones in a very old city.  She is the centre, this is her moment, precarious.', '2009-10-08 01:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679747, 823792, 8891, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Big congrats on your FS Ribbon!</td>', 'Awesome. Big congrats on your FS Ribbon!', '2009-10-08 01:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
