(5679754, 823624, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, glad to see it stuck over the 5.3, although in my mind it should be more like 6.3 than 5.3. I love how you manage to see this type of image. Your timing is always so great.  Please note the 2 10s, so you are surely resonating with a number of people.</td>', 'Deb, glad to see it stuck over the 5.3, although in my mind it should be more like 6.3 than 5.3. I love how you manage to see this type of image. Your timing is always so great.  Please note the 2 10s, so you are surely resonating with a number of people.', '2009-10-08 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679755, 824924, 20330, '<td valign="top">post challenge critique... a crop of just the face processed more, make the eyes pop, tried it in black/white or a bit of desaturation or color alteration, that lucis art look or nicely sharpened.. might have gotten higher scores from DPC voters. (See 8th place in this challenge for an example of what I mean) Personally, I gave it an 8, I liked it, but most voters love that processed look.  :)</td>', 'post challenge critique... a crop of just the face processed more, make the eyes pop, tried it in black/white or a bit of desaturation or color alteration, that lucis art look or nicely sharpened.. might have gotten higher scores from DPC voters. (See 8th place in this challenge for an example of what I mean) Personally, I gave it an 8, I liked it, but most voters love that processed look.  :)', '2009-10-08 01:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679756, 819347, 67145, '<td valign="top">excellent .. i can be the first to congratulate you on such a great place in the free study .. its a fantastic action shot .. CONGRATULATIONS .. !!</td>', 'excellent .. i can be the first to congratulate you on such a great place in the free study .. its a fantastic action shot .. CONGRATULATIONS .. !!', '2009-10-08 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679757, 823624, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now I feel bad because I gave this a 5. I guess that''s why we vote anonymously.</td>', 'Now I feel bad because I gave this a 5. I guess that''s why we vote anonymously.', '2009-10-08 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679758, 821855, 68155, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for all of the wonderful comments.  The answer to everyone''s question...yes this was taken at Burning Man this year.  I shot it with my 20 D inside of scuba casing to keep the dust out.  I shot it on the last day when a sand storm was just kicking up.  Thanks for the comments about it not being DCP eye candy. I try to shoot things that are compelling from an unwritten story point of view.  Photos that beg "what happened before...and or what happened after"  and if i get really luck..."what is happening period"<br/> <br/>The house is an "art car" one of the many things that are at burning man.   This one in particular was the Neverwas car.  You can google it.  I am not sure that i can post URLS.  Ill try.... you are all more than welcome to see more about it on a video montage of photos i created on my website.  I stitched together 5000 stills to create it.  <a href="//www.ruprechtstudios.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.ruprechtstudios.com</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone</td>', 'Thank you everyone for all of the wonderful comments.  The answer to everyone''s question...yes this was taken at Burning Man this year.  I shot it with my 20 D inside of scuba casing to keep the dust out.  I shot it on the last day when a sand storm was just kicking up.  Thanks for the comments about it not being DCP eye candy. I try to shoot things that are compelling from an unwritten story point of view.  Photos that beg "what happened before...and or what happened after"  and if i get really luck..."what is happening period" The house is an "art car" one of the many things that are at burning man.   This one in particular was the Neverwas car.  You can google it.  I am not sure that i can post URLS.  Ill try.... you are all more than welcome to see more about it on a video montage of photos i created on my website.  I stitched together 5000 stills to create it.  //www.ruprechtstudios.com  Thanks everyone', '2009-10-08 01:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679759, 820703, 68504, '<td valign="top">Oh my cup of tea.  Fabulosa.  Joined at the hip.  Complete with bars and stripes and shoes.</td>', 'Oh my cup of tea.  Fabulosa.  Joined at the hip.  Complete with bars and stripes and shoes.', '2009-10-08 01:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679760, 824942, 62357, '<td valign="top">Well, it really did stay at 5.5.  That sucks.  I would have expected to see a much higher score.</td>', 'Well, it really did stay at 5.5.  That sucks.  I would have expected to see a much higher score.', '2009-10-08 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
