(5679810, 820104, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice Finish!</td>', 'Nice Finish!', '2009-10-08 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5679811, 824874, 68504, '<td valign="top">Something about this: first, the red doors, but also the wonderful paned windows above that echo them - and then you start seeing rectangles and squares all over.  Finally your relief comes in decifering the letters on the smudged stone face concerning spirit, earth and renewal, and behold (ecce!) there is a young woman.  (Let me wonder what the Paulist fathers are up to these days in the Holy Ghost Chapel).</td>', 'Something about this: first, the red doors, but also the wonderful paned windows above that echo them - and then you start seeing rectangles and squares all over.  Finally your relief comes in decifering the letters on the smudged stone face concerning spirit, earth and renewal, and behold (ecce!) there is a young woman.  (Let me wonder what the Paulist fathers are up to these days in the Holy Ghost Chapel).', '2009-10-08 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
