(5679870, 824249, 30861, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10. I''m glad, at least, it finished with a score over 6.0, although I think it should have been much higher. Well seen, well done!</td>', 'I gave this a 10. I''m glad, at least, it finished with a score over 6.0, although I think it should have been much higher. Well seen, well done!', '2009-10-08 02:48:53.000000', NULL, 0),
