(5679971, 824273, 82707, '<td valign="top">Hey girl, what happened to you?  I <b>luuvvvv</b> this image, and can''t believe it finished this far back!  I was sure you would kick my butt with this one.  But with that said.....can you make my cheescake ''chocolate''?  :)<br/>...and Deb <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>was on to us too... lol!</td>', 'Hey girl, what happened to you?  I luuvvvv this image, and can''t believe it finished this far back!  I was sure you would kick my butt with this one.  But with that said.....can you make my cheescake ''chocolate''?  :)...and Deb  Melethiawas on to us too... lol!', '2009-10-08 04:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
