(5679998, 824760, 97941, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your comments and votes. All are actually helpful even if I didn''t check the box. To me what I thought was a good shot and one that I like, is just average for most others.<br/> <br/>The adjustments I made were minimal because I was concerned with it looking to harsh or fake. Apparently they weren''t enough. Post processing is and has always been a weakness for me. I''m not sure what I need to do besides keep trying. Using a color calibrated monitor would also help, but I am traveling and can''t take on the extra weight.<br/> <br/>It wasn''t first place and it wasn''t last so I look forward to my next challenge.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your comments and votes. All are actually helpful even if I didn''t check the box. To me what I thought was a good shot and one that I like, is just average for most others. The adjustments I made were minimal because I was concerned with it looking to harsh or fake. Apparently they weren''t enough. Post processing is and has always been a weakness for me. I''m not sure what I need to do besides keep trying. Using a color calibrated monitor would also help, but I am traveling and can''t take on the extra weight. It wasn''t first place and it wasn''t last so I look forward to my next challenge.', '2009-10-08 04:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
