(5680269, 824238, 80904, '<td valign="top">I didnt vote on the free study, but I can tell you what I think went wrong on this photo.<br/> <br/>First the photo is too busy. Too much going on and no one strong focus point.<br/> <br/>My eye seems to struggle between the mountain and the pueblo. The mountain seems to be stronger and I catch myself going in that direction most of the time.<br/> <br/>As far as processing, there is nothing wrong with this photo. Just the composition is not as strong as it should be.<br/> <br/>Too much in the photo and the mountain overpowers the pueblo.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps</td>', 'I didnt vote on the free study, but I can tell you what I think went wrong on this photo. First the photo is too busy. Too much going on and no one strong focus point. My eye seems to struggle between the mountain and the pueblo. The mountain seems to be stronger and I catch myself going in that direction most of the time. As far as processing, there is nothing wrong with this photo. Just the composition is not as strong as it should be. Too much in the photo and the mountain overpowers the pueblo. I hope this helps', '2009-10-08 09:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680276, 824326, 109663, '<td valign="top">This was my first submission.  Thank you for the votes and especially the comments.</td>', 'This was my first submission.  Thank you for the votes and especially the comments.', '2009-10-08 09:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680282, 824233, 46918, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Definately looks like the civil war. Kid needs a rifle though.</td>', 'Nice shot. Definately looks like the civil war. Kid needs a rifle though.', '2009-10-08 09:55:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680287, 820636, 21714, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys. Especially the people who took the time to write something during voting. I am happy that some of you liked it as much as I liked it the minute I saw in on my LCD. I worked hard to get this shot and I am happy that I was able to capture it as I wanted while she was doing her own thing and moving like a fish. <br/>Whatever the score, whatever the placing, I would still throw this in with what I consider as my best images.<br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks guys. Especially the people who took the time to write something during voting. I am happy that some of you liked it as much as I liked it the minute I saw in on my LCD. I worked hard to get this shot and I am happy that I was able to capture it as I wanted while she was doing her own thing and moving like a fish. Whatever the score, whatever the placing, I would still throw this in with what I consider as my best images.Thanks again.', '2009-10-08 09:58:32.000000', NULL, 0),
