(5680476, 825054, 50641, '<td valign="top">Love the composition.  From her expression, I think the horse may be munching on really exquisite sushi, or maybe some black butterfly roquefort?  That their mouths are missing makes this more interesting, imho.    The pale shades appeal to me too - I wonder about going really pale, turning them into whispers.</td>', 'Love the composition.  From her expression, I think the horse may be munching on really exquisite sushi, or maybe some black butterfly roquefort?  That their mouths are missing makes this more interesting, imho.    The pale shades appeal to me too - I wonder about going really pale, turning them into whispers.', '2009-10-08 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680507, 822848, 46918, '<td valign="top">I can say that boat has seen better days...Good image I definately like it</td>', 'I can say that boat has seen better days...Good image I definately like it', '2009-10-08 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680508, 823134, 62357, '<td valign="top">Not going to be much help for you here I''m afraid, as I was one of your 7s.  I do in fact agree with you it is a wonderful image and I can only just imagine what it looks like printed.  Normally I go back over my votes and tweak scores, but this week I didn''t get chance.  I feel pretty sure this is one that would have had a bump up.  I can totally understand why you are not happy with the outcome.  I assume it didn''t score how you would have liked due to the abstract nature, but for me that''s what makes it.  As I have been discussing with a couple of other members this week, it is increasingly difficult to predict what will work in a Free Study, which makes choosing even harder than it has been in the past.  There are at least 24 of us who liked it though that maybe small consolation.</td>', 'Not going to be much help for you here I''m afraid, as I was one of your 7s.  I do in fact agree with you it is a wonderful image and I can only just imagine what it looks like printed.  Normally I go back over my votes and tweak scores, but this week I didn''t get chance.  I feel pretty sure this is one that would have had a bump up.  I can totally understand why you are not happy with the outcome.  I assume it didn''t score how you would have liked due to the abstract nature, but for me that''s what makes it.  As I have been discussing with a couple of other members this week, it is increasingly difficult to predict what will work in a Free Study, which makes choosing even harder than it has been in the past.  There are at least 24 of us who liked it though that maybe small consolation.', '2009-10-08 13:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
