(5680648, 825048, 68504, '<td valign="top">Uh oh.  I see a dog face, a very decomposing alert and menacing dog face.  But that''s just me.</td>', 'Uh oh.  I see a dog face, a very decomposing alert and menacing dog face.  But that''s just me.', '2009-10-08 15:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
