(5680668, 820703, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this.  You get the impression these two have been together for ages, don''t you?  Same postures, more or less.  And yet they''re not even paying attention to each other.  They don''t need to after all this time - they just enjoy the time out together, even if they do have their own thoughts.  A very nice catch - well seen and good you got your camera up and the shot taken before the light changed!  I find myself wishing I''d do stuff like that a lot.</td>', 'I quite like this.  You get the impression these two have been together for ages, don''t you?  Same postures, more or less.  And yet they''re not even paying attention to each other.  They don''t need to after all this time - they just enjoy the time out together, even if they do have their own thoughts.  A very nice catch - well seen and good you got your camera up and the shot taken before the light changed!  I find myself wishing I''d do stuff like that a lot.', '2009-10-08 16:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
