(5680694, 823134, 32767, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a fine image. If I were to venture to guess why it didn''t do very well or register with voters I might say it lacks musicality. The image strikes me more like a complex chord which is fine in itself but doesn''t have enough elements to make the average viewer sway to it''s rhythm. I can get lost in it but for people breezing through, at a few seconds...you know they won''t take the time to feel or explore the energy.</td>', 'I think it''s a fine image. If I were to venture to guess why it didn''t do very well or register with voters I might say it lacks musicality. The image strikes me more like a complex chord which is fine in itself but doesn''t have enough elements to make the average viewer sway to it''s rhythm. I can get lost in it but for people breezing through, at a few seconds...you know they won''t take the time to feel or explore the energy.', '2009-10-08 16:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
