(5680747, 824886, 48245, '<td valign="top">Janice, <br/> <br/>There was something about this image that I liked and during the voting period I actually downloaded it and tried my hand at some simple edits to try to "pop" it up a bit. Here was my result:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=826618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48245/120/826618.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48245/120/826618.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/48245/120/826618.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>All the edits were done with Picasa.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'Janice,  There was something about this image that I liked and during the voting period I actually downloaded it and tried my hand at some simple edits to try to "pop" it up a bit. Here was my result:   All the edits were done with Picasa. David', '2009-10-08 16:59:45.000000', NULL, 0),
