(5680812, 825036, 43463, '<td valign="top">The oranges and golds are nice and vibrant especially when it pops off that black backdrop. Lighting is good such that it not only shows off the beautiful colors but shows off all the great texture details in the petals.</td>', 'The oranges and golds are nice and vibrant especially when it pops off that black backdrop. Lighting is good such that it not only shows off the beautiful colors but shows off all the great texture details in the petals.', '2009-10-08 17:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680820, 824840, 43463, '<td valign="top">The image grain, B&amp; W presentation, and the off kilter angle of this young girl gives this a very artsy type feel. A quick capture of a fleeting moment is what the mood feels - I get that from the angle this is presented in. Love the B&amp;W treatment - the feelings of nostalgia and ''a captured moment in time to be cherished'' would not work in color I feel. I didn''t know what the object was in the top left corner til I read the description. The partial soccer ball is odd - I wonder how it would have looked with the full ball there and would it have detracted attention from the young girl.</td>', 'The image grain, B& W presentation, and the off kilter angle of this young girl gives this a very artsy type feel. A quick capture of a fleeting moment is what the mood feels - I get that from the angle this is presented in. Love the B&W treatment - the feelings of nostalgia and ''a captured moment in time to be cherished'' would not work in color I feel. I didn''t know what the object was in the top left corner til I read the description. The partial soccer ball is odd - I wonder how it would have looked with the full ball there and would it have detracted attention from the young girl.', '2009-10-08 17:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
