(5680889, 823624, 30214, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. I loved the contre-jour lighting and the tilt, and the kid is great. One thing I did not like much were the christmas colors of the glare, they stand out too much. I would probably just make everything sepia (it is almost sepia as it is already).  Good shot regardless!</td>', 'I gave it a 6. I loved the contre-jour lighting and the tilt, and the kid is great. One thing I did not like much were the christmas colors of the glare, they stand out too much. I would probably just make everything sepia (it is almost sepia as it is already).  Good shot regardless!', '2009-10-08 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680891, 822441, 100393, '<td valign="top">Goodness me - I had just presumed this was an aquarium shot. This goes from excellent to unbelievable in my book!</td>', 'Goodness me - I had just presumed this was an aquarium shot. This goes from excellent to unbelievable in my book!', '2009-10-08 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5680894, 821510, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rkligman:</b></div><hr/><i> Everything above their head needs to be cropped </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Absolutely not! The vignette and their lurking low in the frame is what gives this its impact.</td>', 'Originally posted by rkligman: Everything above their head needs to be cropped   Absolutely not! The vignette and their lurking low in the frame is what gives this its impact.', '2009-10-08 19:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
