(5680920, 823456, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>An excellent photo, and by far my favourite floral entry in the FS.  I''m somewhat surprised the this didn''t score higher than it did... DPC voters keep us all guessing.  Composition is perfect, centre is sharp and you''ve used the shallow DOF well.  Well done.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  An excellent photo, and by far my favourite floral entry in the FS.  I''m somewhat surprised the this didn''t score higher than it did... DPC voters keep us all guessing.  Composition is perfect, centre is sharp and you''ve used the shallow DOF well.  Well done.', '2009-10-08 20:01:05.000000', NULL, 0),
