(5681046, 821824, 62895, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is. The focus is good, and the subject is cool, but it just lacks pop. (not in contrast or color) I think maybe it''s because there is too much of the same thing. The focal point kind of blends in with the rest of the image, making it seem bland. Sorry I can''t be more specific. The truth is, I''m not exactly sure why myself. I voted this a 6.</td>', 'Not sure what it is. The focus is good, and the subject is cool, but it just lacks pop. (not in contrast or color) I think maybe it''s because there is too much of the same thing. The focal point kind of blends in with the rest of the image, making it seem bland. Sorry I can''t be more specific. The truth is, I''m not exactly sure why myself. I voted this a 6.', '2009-10-08 21:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
