(5682053, 824979, 27482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by soup:</b></div><hr/><i> yeah - that''s a major thing for me though.  looks fake, OP''d and to be honest - terrible IMO.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LVicari:</b></div><hr/><i>The skin on her torso is not processed the same as her face. Its a minor thing but still noticeable for me. 9</i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What are you talking about?  I didn´t touch her skintones in post processing so PP has nothing to do with it, as a matter of fact, this shot is almost basic editing legal, with the only exception a tiny blemish that I removed from her left cheek.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-09 18:48:06.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by soup: yeah - that''s a major thing for me though.  looks fake, OP''d and to be honest - terrible IMO. Originally posted by LVicari:The skin on her torso is not processed the same as her face. Its a minor thing but still noticeable for me. 9   What are you talking about?  I didn´t touch her skintones in post processing so PP has nothing to do with it, as a matter of fact, this shot is almost basic editing legal, with the only exception a tiny blemish that I removed from her left cheek.', '2009-10-09 18:39:45.000000', '2009-10-09 19:48:06.000000', 0),
(5682054, 825025, 70369, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Aw man, I shoulda known O''s and E''s, but they weren''t wearing uniforms, so how would I know?  :-)  By the way, Vandyland is my favorite AFB in the whole world.  Granted, Ramstein isn''t bad (though I''m not actually assigned there) but Vandyland is wonderful.  I''d love to move back to that area.  I gave this a 7.  Great action shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OH WOW, you lived here..... I''m born &amp; raised here, but the hubby''s been stationed for about 11 years now.. We''ve been married for 5, so we''re hoping &amp; praying we don''t have to move.. We love it too..</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: Aw man, I shoulda known O''s and E''s, but they weren''t wearing uniforms, so how would I know?  :-)  By the way, Vandyland is my favorite AFB in the whole world.  Granted, Ramstein isn''t bad (though I''m not actually assigned there) but Vandyland is wonderful.  I''d love to move back to that area.  I gave this a 7.  Great action shot!   OH WOW, you lived here..... I''m born & raised here, but the hubby''s been stationed for about 11 years now.. We''ve been married for 5, so we''re hoping & praying we don''t have to move.. We love it too..', '2009-10-09 18:40:22.000000', NULL, 0),
