(5682438, 824961, 33535, '<td valign="top">Ah, yours is better! (though I like your outtake with his left eye open and staring at you even better)<br/>Again sorry for the loss of your english paper, but this scenery was just too much, man! ;-)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a>, forget about wonder and innocence, these are gypsies. They have probably seen more misery and "sin" in their young life than any of us counted together...</td>', 'Ah, yours is better! (though I like your outtake with his left eye open and staring at you even better)Again sorry for the loss of your english paper, but this scenery was just too much, man! ;-)  bvy, forget about wonder and innocence, these are gypsies. They have probably seen more misery and "sin" in their young life than any of us counted together...', '2009-10-10 07:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
