(5682954, 824868, 101678, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Ahhhhhhhh. . . . food for my soul seeing this scene -- still suffering from my Texas vs. Oregon scenery depression!   Congratulations, Miles!  You KNOW what I think of this -- and every other one of your photos!  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Sandy!  I''m just waiting for your return trip :)</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Ahhhhhhhh. . . . food for my soul seeing this scene -- still suffering from my Texas vs. Oregon scenery depression!   Congratulations, Miles!  You KNOW what I think of this -- and every other one of your photos!  :)   Thanks Sandy!  I''m just waiting for your return trip :)', '2009-10-10 21:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
