(5683273, 823134, 32767, '<td valign="top">There''s a line from Charles Trenets <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=-iEhoLjgmB8&amp;feature=related" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">La Mer</a> <br/> <br/>Le Mer...<i>Ses blancs moutons Avec les anges si purs</i> <br/> <br/>The Sea<br/>With the summer skies confound<br/><i>It''s white sheep with angels so pure</i>...<br/> <br/>Though your image might be of a river or a stream...the line fits.<br/> <br/>eta:I think his song might suggest high contrast and slightly elevated color, saturation levels with a little D&amp;B and delicate vignetting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-11 10:16:57.</i></td>', 'There''s a line from Charles Trenets La Mer  Le Mer...Ses blancs moutons Avec les anges si purs  The SeaWith the summer skies confoundIt''s white sheep with angels so pure... Though your image might be of a river or a stream...the line fits. eta:I think his song might suggest high contrast and slightly elevated color, saturation levels with a little D&B and delicate vignetting.', '2009-10-11 09:30:40.000000', '2009-10-11 11:16:57.000000', 0),
