(5688433, 823207, 107474, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for voting for my shot.  This is my first, ever, entry and I did not know what to expect, as I am also new to DPChallenge.  I appreciate all the high scores!  I got a few nines!  Your comments gave me inspiration and support.  Thank you!<br/> <br/>Shot in: RAW<br/>Few minor adjustments in Nik''s Viveza for brightness and contrast.  Otherwise, it is as shot.<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Thank you everyone for voting for my shot.  This is my first, ever, entry and I did not know what to expect, as I am also new to DPChallenge.  I appreciate all the high scores!  I got a few nines!  Your comments gave me inspiration and support.  Thank you! Shot in: RAWFew minor adjustments in Nik''s Viveza for brightness and contrast.  Otherwise, it is as shot. Thanks!', '2009-10-15 14:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
