(5691118, 824961, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mephisto:</b></div><hr/><i><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a>, forget about wonder and innocence, these are gypsies. They have probably seen more misery and "sin" in their young life than any of us counted together... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>"Innocence" might have been a stretch, but I think all kids retain a sense of wonder -- rich and poor alike. Someday, perhaps, I''ll be able to go there and see it all for myself.</td>', 'Originally posted by Mephisto: bvy, forget about wonder and innocence, these are gypsies. They have probably seen more misery and "sin" in their young life than any of us counted together...   "Innocence" might have been a stretch, but I think all kids retain a sense of wonder -- rich and poor alike. Someday, perhaps, I''ll be able to go there and see it all for myself.', '2009-10-18 12:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5691145, 824961, 68586, '<td valign="top">Cool shot on many levels.</td>', 'Cool shot on many levels.', '2009-10-18 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5691985, 825017, 24666, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully simple protrait , was also one of my favourite pictures in the Challenge. Really like the out of focus flowers in the foreground as they in no way detract from the model<br/> <br/><a href="//malefiftyplus.blogspot.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Check out my Blog</a></td>', 'This is a beautifully simple protrait , was also one of my favourite pictures in the Challenge. Really like the out of focus flowers in the foreground as they in no way detract from the model Check out my Blog', '2009-10-19 08:29:50.000000', NULL, 0),
