(5715402, 824937, 90829, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> wow, what a pretty lighthouse...where exactly is this? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sankaty is on the eastern shore of Nantucket Island, in Siasconset, at the end of Baxter Street. This was taken out the window of our jeep and I regret that we didn''t drive closer to get more pictures. Next time. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: wow, what a pretty lighthouse...where exactly is this?   Sankaty is on the eastern shore of Nantucket Island, in Siasconset, at the end of Baxter Street. This was taken out the window of our jeep and I regret that we didn''t drive closer to get more pictures. Next time. :)', '2009-11-05 13:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
