(5746980, 823134, 100393, '<td valign="top">I never scored or commented on this image at the point of submission (my long comment series seems to take so much of my time); I wish I had taken time to score and comment on this though - this is a very fine image; not at all a match for its 5.3379 score. 301st is just plain wrong; but then what do I know - the 10s I gave in the 2009-09 FS came 43rd, 102nd, 103rd, 138th, 149th, 151st and 214th.</td>', 'I never scored or commented on this image at the point of submission (my long comment series seems to take so much of my time); I wish I had taken time to score and comment on this though - this is a very fine image; not at all a match for its 5.3379 score. 301st is just plain wrong; but then what do I know - the 10s I gave in the 2009-09 FS came 43rd, 102nd, 103rd, 138th, 149th, 151st and 214th.', '2009-11-30 15:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
