(5924241, 821280, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you give this image a whirl....it ain''t easy, that''s for sure. One thing I find at this location is that it''s easier to get the exposure right when the multi-colours are on. The white lights tend to cause over-exposure and lost highlight details.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice to see you give this image a whirl....it ain''t easy, that''s for sure. One thing I find at this location is that it''s easier to get the exposure right when the multi-colours are on. The white lights tend to cause over-exposure and lost highlight details. ', '2010-03-31 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6008702, 825055, 103142, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cool! It makes your eyes go buggy.</td>', 'That''s pretty cool! It makes your eyes go buggy.', '2010-05-15 23:06:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6013983, 825019, 20577, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.', '2010-05-18 23:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6087499, 824277, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow ... I must have been sleeping since I missed this beauty last September. I love your title and the picture is amazing. You and this bridge are "one". However if you choose to live there, don''t live under it cause that would make you a troll lol!</td>', 'Wow ... I must have been sleeping since I missed this beauty last September. I love your title and the picture is amazing. You and this bridge are "one". However if you choose to live there, don''t live under it cause that would make you a troll lol!', '2010-07-10 16:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6175375, 823792, 69008, '<td valign="top">This shot deserves the ribbon!  <br/>Thanks for the tip about quicker shooting. I have noticed that in many of the storms in this area, that the bolts come at fairly regular intervals. For instance, if I count seconds between 1st and 2nd strikes, I have found that the 3rd strike will occur roughly at the same interval. I then adjust shooting to match that. If the strikes are coming at 15 sec intervals, I wait 12 sec or so after a strike to open the shutter. Sometimes you miss a bolt that comes in the interim, and have to restart the countdown, but the technique helps on the average.</td>', 'This shot deserves the ribbon!  Thanks for the tip about quicker shooting. I have noticed that in many of the storms in this area, that the bolts come at fairly regular intervals. For instance, if I count seconds between 1st and 2nd strikes, I have found that the 3rd strike will occur roughly at the same interval. I then adjust shooting to match that. If the strikes are coming at 15 sec intervals, I wait 12 sec or so after a strike to open the shutter. Sometimes you miss a bolt that comes in the interim, and have to restart the countdown, but the technique helps on the average.', '2010-09-30 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6192505, 819209, 40718, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah.  Knowing now what''s behind these images (an ungodly amount of patience), this shot is awesome! you have the focus spot on and a great moment in time captured.  6.09?  You have to be kidding!</td>', 'Oh yeah.  Knowing now what''s behind these images (an ungodly amount of patience), this shot is awesome! you have the focus spot on and a great moment in time captured.  6.09?  You have to be kidding!', '2010-10-15 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6199051, 821824, 6388, '<td valign="top">the most awesome thing about this photo is that you still have jean-luc picard as your avatar.<br/> <br/>that is all.</td>', 'the most awesome thing about this photo is that you still have jean-luc picard as your avatar. that is all.', '2010-10-23 02:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
