(6404676, 819757, 30982, '<td valign="top">How cool!  You and Tom not only finished next to each other, but you both got Paul''s "longer look" comments!  I didn''t realize he''d be doing it for that long, did you?  This shot works very well for me - I can visit with it for a long time.  Note the commenter average on this one.</td>', 'How cool!  You and Tom not only finished next to each other, but you both got Paul''s "longer look" comments!  I didn''t realize he''d be doing it for that long, did you?  This shot works very well for me - I can visit with it for a long time.  Note the commenter average on this one.', '2011-05-05 00:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
